worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_factual_qa.js"
  ceiling 891
  rationale "Subject-verified factual Q&A (issue #1172 R2, R6, R7), the browser twin of rust/src/solver_handlers/factual_qa.rs and rust/src/solver_handlers/prompt_text_question.rs. The subject gate resolves the formalized question's subject slot to a Q-id through the fact store's own label index; seeded comparisons align both subjects' facts by relation; questions over a quoted passage answer from its own sentences with no network call. Cues are meanings of data/seed/meanings-facts.lino and the wording is data/seed/multilingual-responses-entities.lino; growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling moved 475 to 576 for the issue #1172 R3 live-answer twin of rust/src/solver_handlers/fact_live_answer.rs: factLiveQuestion formalizes the relation and subject term from seed cues, factClaimReference reads the reference URL the claim cites through the registry row, and factLiveSummary renders the seeded fact_live_answer template; formal_ai_worker_10.js dropped its hardcoded FACT_RESPONSE_TEMPLATES table and the unused sitelink helper in the same move. Ceiling moved 576 to 671 for the issue #1172 R8 explanation twin of try_explanation_research over research_page_senses (the issue #1163 R4 retrieve-and-formalize path): explanationConcept reads the capability_act_explain cue from seed, researchPageSenses captures each Instant Answer result page with its SHA-256, ranks it by the seed trust score and quotes every paragraph or list item that mentions the concept through the explanation_research templates. Ceiling moved 671 to 774 for the issue #1172 R7 statement projection, the twin of project_statement and statement_answer in rust/src/solver_handlers/prompt_text_question.rs: promptTextStatement splits the covering sentence into subject, predicate, object, time and place slots by the seeded statement_time_preposition, statement_place_preposition, weekday, month, hour and statement_clock_suffix surfaces, and promptTextStatementAnswer states the slots the question asks (statement_*_question) through the seeded prompt_text_slot templates. The Rust twin is the authority; this mirror keeps the browser answer byte-identical. Ceiling moved to 891 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the browser twin of rust/src/release_timeline.rs (releaseTimelineRegistry, renderReleaseTimeline) renders a release-timeline fact from data/seed/release-timelines.lino; before it the worker answered such a fact with an empty string."
